{"version":1,"content":"<p>菲爾茲獎得主、著名數學家陶哲軒（Terence Tao）近日對人類日益依賴人工智能發出警告。他擔心，隨着人們逐漸將思考和解決問題的過程交給AI，人類正在失去對問題本身及其解決方案的理解，而這一趨勢可能很快在現實世界中產生嚴重後果。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584966.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:05:46.820501+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:53:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:32.742884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:32.742884+00:00","content_hash":"0e20c4250e5332a0b2c5c151231d734ecfff84bb4dfe7d19e5975f1c7d5e611b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}